SCOPE

This license covers the original work in this repository: the steel core design,
the weldment geometry, the engine cradle, the build documentation, and the
derived dimensions and measurements.

It does NOT cover, and this repository does not redistribute:

  - The PolarStar F2 engine and FCU CAD models, which are the property of
    PolarStar Airsoft and are referenced for fitment only.
  - The original 3D-printed Browning M2 receiver model from which the cosmetic
    skin geometry is derived. See ATTRIBUTION in README.md.
